* Navigation Agent
* Participant Agent
* Release Agent
* Reporting Agent

For every question you ask, please submit feedback on the quality and usefulness of the response. Your feedback will directly shape the improvements required before external release.

**How we will support this effort**

To ensure that Workplace Coach continues to improve while maintaining consistent quality, the technology team has established a continuous evaluation process:

* We will work with business teams to identify representative business questions that will become part of our ongoing regression and evaluation suite.
* These regression scenarios will be executed continuously as the platform evolves, ensuring that new enhancements do not negatively impact existing capabilities.
* A weekly dashboard will be shared summarizing adoption, the number of questions evaluated across each agent, key themes from user feedback, and progress made in addressing identified gaps.

This disciplined feedback and regression process will provide the evidence needed to build confidence across Technology, Risk, Model Management, and the business as we prepare Workplace Coach for external availability.

